# BUZZBOLT: a kill is worth the foe's points times the multiplier. The
# gnats the second boss calls in are worth ten times their usual 10; the
# last boss is worth nothing.
game buzzbolt
# the opening: A skips it
press A
press A
wait 10
press A
cheat quiet
wait 130
cheat pos 160 150
cheat mult 7
cheat dummy 0 160 100
press A
wait 10
expect score == 70
cheat dummy 4 160 100
cheat hp 0 1
press A
wait 10
expect score == 1470
cheat mult 3
cheat dummy 11 160 100
press A
wait 10
expect score == 2370
cheat score 0
cheat mult 9
cheat dummy 14 160 100
cheat hp 0 1
press A
wait 10
expect foes == 0
expect score == 0
# the second boss's gnats
cheat wave 2
cheat god
cheat boss
waituntil gnat_value == 100 1200
